+Actual XR-owner component tested offscreen on the real GPU: two jobs from source state 1, 16,384 pixels checked against independently constructed camera fixtures, 2,304 changed pixels from the new pose and unchanged source. No XR session or game in that test. The final generation-retention fix rebuild is 12739701, with 156 full-suite VR tests passing.
